{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfZbBffB2VftzPWjvs4X9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Acceptance criteria mapping:**\n\n1. ✅ **Existing build passes** → BUILD SUCCESS with all 17 tests passing\n2. ✅ **Existing tests pass** → All 5 original ShipmentControllerTest tests still pass\n3. ✅ **POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm confirms created shipment and persists** → Test \"confirms a created shipment and moves it to confirmed status\" verifies status change and persistence\n4. ✅ **Error responses consistent with API** → Uses existing `ConflictException` and `ResourceNotFoundException` patterns with `ErrorCode` enum (no custom response building)\n5. ✅ **Repeated confirm succeeds; cancelled refused; unknown id refused** → Three tests cover these scenarios:\n   - \"confirms an already confirmed shipment idempotently\" (idempotency)\n   - \"rejects confirming a cancelled shipment with 409 conflict\" (409 rejection)\n   - \"rejects confirming a non-existent shipment with 404\" (404 rejection)\n6. ✅ **No new Maven dependency** → Only edited .kt files, no pom.xml changes\n7. ✅ **No unrelated production file changes** → Only ShipmentController.kt and ApiError.kt modified (both necessary)\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n- **ApiError.kt** - Added `SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATUS` enum value (necessary for the 409 rejection case)\n- **ShipmentController.kt** - Added `confirm()` method with `@PostMapping(\"/{shipmentId}/confirm\")` annotation (necessary core feature)\n- **ShipmentControllerTest.kt** - Added 4 test methods covering all cases including idempotency, cancelled rejection, and not-found cases (necessary for verification)\n\n**Unresolved findings:** None. All cases mentioned in the ticket are implemented and tested.\n\n---\n\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n\n```\nRequirement   Add POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm endpoint that moves CREATED shipments to CONFIRMED, is idempotent for already-CONFIRMED shipments